{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a tale of bittersweet homecoming!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Elias returns to the coastal town that once sheltered him, he\u2019s pulled into a slow winter of connection, memory and quiet decisions. Take the role of this young man and guide the choices he makes, surrounded by the warmth of townspeople young and old, often holding conversations in a bookstore over shared coffee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winterlight is a contemplative visual novel adventure about coming home, facing grief and learning to accept the ordinary over means of personal escape. Enjoy an adventure in a branching narrative with meaningful choices, one filled with emotional maturity and beautiful illustrations. Take things at your own pace as you explore all possible outcomes for Elias.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in an adventure spanning 32,000 words!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in emotionally mature themes and real-world issues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide the narrative by making key decisions for Elias!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy beautifully illustrated character portraits and backdrops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover multiple endings as you seek truth and lasting peace!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4043300?t=1760767284","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043300/ff840a369e13540ed1633b6576cc0ed794a4c043/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760767284","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043300/d4b69c1ca1beb71a539890f8a7596c0e34f6a378/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760767284","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043300/d4b69c1ca1beb71a539890f8a7596c0e34f6a378/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760767284","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a tale of bittersweet homecoming!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Elias returns to the coastal town that once sheltered him, he\u2019s pulled into a slow winter of connection, memory and quiet decisions. Take the role of this young man and guide the choices he makes, surrounded by the warmth of townspeople young and old, often holding conversations in a bookstore over shared coffee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winterlight is a contemplative visual novel adventure about coming home, facing grief and learning to accept the ordinary over means of personal escape. Enjoy an adventure in a branching narrative with meaningful choices, one filled with emotional maturity and beautiful illustrations. Take things at your own pace as you explore all possible outcomes for Elias.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in an adventure spanning 32,000 words!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in emotionally mature themes and real-world issues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide the narrative by making key decisions for Elias!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy beautifully illustrated character portraits and backdrops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover multiple endings as you seek truth and lasting peace!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Eastasiasoft Limited, SMV Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043300/bdccc67e98a04ffadf1135886c2549a4f9352ccb/header.jpg?t=1760767284","is_free":false,"leg